          "end_column": 37,
          "symbol": "ConditionalMosaic.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, a, b, flag):\n    left = self.bend(a)\n    right = self.bend(b)\n    if flag:\n        changed = a + torch.cos(torch.sin(a))\n    else:\n        changed = unfamiliar_bridge(b)\n    return left - right + changed"
        }
      ],
